    "detailed_description": "<br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/63e9d419a4b1df2abfdf1ba3f9f9dd57.avif?t=1749631021\" width=616 height=92 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Banker Simulator \u2013 Ready to Discover the Challenges of the Financial World?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a failing bank and fight to bring it back to life. Make strategic decisions to increase customer satisfaction, invest wisely, and overcome financial crises. Manage risks, grow your bank, and solidify your position in the industry. In this thrilling simulation game, you'll need to be both a financial expert and a master strategist!c<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/edb91b49fe5ed8f73afc44161c626558.poster.avif?t=1749631021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/edb91b49fe5ed8f73afc44161c626558.webm?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/edb91b49fe5ed8f73afc44161c626558.mp4?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REALISTIC COUNTERFEIT MONEY SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big profits come with big risks! Print counterfeit money to boost your bank\u2019s power, and launder it without leaving a trace to dominate the financial world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/dd77c7927abdc1844d3a8944b396b55c.poster.avif?t=1749631021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/dd77c7927abdc1844d3a8944b396b55c.webm?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/dd77c7927abdc1844d3a8944b396b55c.mp4?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IDENTITY VERIFICATION &amp; FRAUD DETECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every customer is trustworthy! Verify identities, detect forged documents, and protect your bank\u2019s reputation.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/7d800db8090860a38ae88941d0565df5.poster.avif?t=1749631021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/7d800db8090860a38ae88941d0565df5.webm?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/7d800db8090860a38ae88941d0565df5.mp4?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIVE THE LUXURY LIFE \u2013 SPEND, INVEST &amp; RISE TO THE TOP!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banking is just the beginning! Use your earnings to live in luxury, make profitable investments, and build your prestige.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/c81c14f3e98b1d4c51d5061a1584dfb0.poster.avif?t=1749631021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/c81c14f3e98b1d4c51d5061a1584dfb0.webm?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/c81c14f3e98b1d4c51d5061a1584dfb0.mp4?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMER SATISFACTION &amp; BANK MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust is the foundation of a successful bank! Offer top-tier financial services to increase customer satisfaction, close lucrative deals, and build a loyal clientele.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/b83eb5330c6dddaed29b27cfa05dd13c.poster.avif?t=1749631021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/b83eb5330c6dddaed29b27cfa05dd13c.webm?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/b83eb5330c6dddaed29b27cfa05dd13c.mp4?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CASH MANAGEMENT &amp; TELLER OPERATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle large volumes of cash flow and ensure all bank transactions run smoothly. Every banknote counts!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/a81cd7941c544097f61f9143f6474e7c.poster.avif?t=1749631021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/a81cd7941c544097f61f9143f6474e7c.webm?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/a81cd7941c544097f61f9143f6474e7c.mp4?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no limit to how much money you can make! Take control of the financial world, build your own banking empire, and rise to the top. Add <i>Banker Simulator</i> to your Wishlist today and be among the first to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/63e9d419a4b1df2abfdf1ba3f9f9dd57.avif?t=1749631021\" width=616 height=92 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Banker Simulator \u2013 Ready to Discover the Challenges of the Financial World?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a failing bank and fight to bring it back to life. Make strategic decisions to increase customer satisfaction, invest wisely, and overcome financial crises. Manage risks, grow your bank, and solidify your position in the industry. In this thrilling simulation game, you'll need to be both a financial expert and a master strategist!c<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/edb91b49fe5ed8f73afc44161c626558.poster.avif?t=1749631021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/edb91b49fe5ed8f73afc44161c626558.webm?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/edb91b49fe5ed8f73afc44161c626558.mp4?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REALISTIC COUNTERFEIT MONEY SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big profits come with big risks! Print counterfeit money to boost your bank\u2019s power, and launder it without leaving a trace to dominate the financial world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/dd77c7927abdc1844d3a8944b396b55c.poster.avif?t=1749631021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/dd77c7927abdc1844d3a8944b396b55c.webm?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/dd77c7927abdc1844d3a8944b396b55c.mp4?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IDENTITY VERIFICATION &amp; FRAUD DETECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every customer is trustworthy! Verify identities, detect forged documents, and protect your bank\u2019s reputation.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/7d800db8090860a38ae88941d0565df5.poster.avif?t=1749631021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/7d800db8090860a38ae88941d0565df5.webm?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/7d800db8090860a38ae88941d0565df5.mp4?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIVE THE LUXURY LIFE \u2013 SPEND, INVEST &amp; RISE TO THE TOP!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banking is just the beginning! Use your earnings to live in luxury, make profitable investments, and build your prestige.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/c81c14f3e98b1d4c51d5061a1584dfb0.poster.avif?t=1749631021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/c81c14f3e98b1d4c51d5061a1584dfb0.webm?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/c81c14f3e98b1d4c51d5061a1584dfb0.mp4?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMER SATISFACTION &amp; BANK MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust is the foundation of a successful bank! Offer top-tier financial services to increase customer satisfaction, close lucrative deals, and build a loyal clientele.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/b83eb5330c6dddaed29b27cfa05dd13c.poster.avif?t=1749631021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/b83eb5330c6dddaed29b27cfa05dd13c.webm?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/b83eb5330c6dddaed29b27cfa05dd13c.mp4?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CASH MANAGEMENT &amp; TELLER OPERATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle large volumes of cash flow and ensure all bank transactions run smoothly. Every banknote counts!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/a81cd7941c544097f61f9143f6474e7c.poster.avif?t=1749631021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/a81cd7941c544097f61f9143f6474e7c.webm?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/a81cd7941c544097f61f9143f6474e7c.mp4?t=1749631021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no limit to how much money you can make! Take control of the financial world, build your own banking empire, and rise to the top. Add <i>Banker Simulator</i> to your Wishlist today and be among the first to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
